Bind Npc 14424 Zone 12
Quest 1010 "Brahman hunt"
    Journal "[Ascetic] Tabeth asked me to hunt 40 Brahmans."
    Kill 40 of 2103, 2153 at direction_606

Requires player level >= 62 and player is elmorad and quest 312 is completed

Rewards
    Give 26250000 experience

direction_606 = location "Brahman" about "Brahman\nNomad priests of Esoteric Buddhism, they lose their souls and turn into savage mages of darkness at night. They employ electric shock and magic that removes HP blessing. " found "El Morad Eslant" at 594 251 in zone 12

On available
    Say "Master, Veda is going to start you on the second training. Go and see him~"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Are you ready for the second round of training?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "The second training target is our friend, the Brahman. Brahman are in a completely different class to the Esoteric Buddhist Monks. His nonstop attacks won't give you any breathing time. It's a tougher opponent than perhaps what you're used to, but for training, this can only be a good thing. What do you think?"

On in_progress
    Say "The road of practice must be walked with patience."
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_606

On claimable
    Show quest "Well done. Was it a hard hunt? But I can see the results of your training already. Well done. Heh."
